 "description": "A steel column with a 50 x 50 mm square cross-section, height 500 mm along z, base at z=0 (centred on the z axis). It stands on a frictionless rigid floor (no vertical displacement of the base, free horizontal motion) and is loaded only by a uniform body acceleration of 1e+06 mm/s^2 in -z (an inertial load of ~102 g). Rigid-body motion in the horizontal plane must be suppressed without restraining the free lateral (Poisson) deformation, e.g. ux=uy=0 at base corner [-25.0, -25.0, 0.0] and uy=0 at base corner [25.0, -25.0, 0.0].",
